{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/8d9271962af75e7b44ed07ec56aab7e3.avif?t=1682010912\" width=352 height=82 /></span><br>The survivors is a game in an open world populated by zombies and fanatical rebels but also survivors helped, craft and base bulding, missions are to be discovered<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > What Is the Survivors</h2></h2>Your transport plane has crashed you must survive the crash in a world populated by zombies and fanatics<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features</h2></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover A World Rich In Original Places</li></ul></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/800bb66dfef6fd845b6296be23230838.avif?t=1682010912\" width=570 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><li> Fight Different Style Of Zombies<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2></li><li> Fight Armed Fanatics<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/2b090ef6629dcbb64b987ade40f1de98.avif?t=1682010912\" width=576 height=198 /></span><br></li><li> build its base, manage its electricity, its resources, recruit npc's which will produce building materials, ammunition, care<br></li><li> stop the proliferation of zombies by making traps<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Collect figurines from this world to decorate your base<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet other factions, complete helicopter rescue missions, reconstruction missions, delivery missions, deliver civilians, buy vehicles as rewards</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/3a88ff1aa99a7f31a7493e66bcd61953.avif?t=1682010912\" width=580 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Gameplay Style </strong></h2></h2></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >it's An Survival Game Style.</h2></h2>it's a deliberately arcade style, oriented on missions and action, and the discovery of the world, here you will only have few weapons in the often identical game play, no zombies to kill at 100m.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Developpement : Road Map </strong></h2></h2>we plan to to add new vehicles and their improvements, zombie bosses, new missions and a trade system between factions....<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/908adfcea82c3cb09194997622f86f6f.avif?t=1682010912\" width=580 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >what to Enjoy</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/fadc5d048c9a49d4166321795e2112eb.poster.avif?t=1682010912\" width=704 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/fadc5d048c9a49d4166321795e2112eb.webm?t=1682010912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/fadc5d048c9a49d4166321795e2112eb.mp4?t=1682010912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul></li>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2264410?t=1682010912","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2264410?t=1682010912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1682010912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1682010912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Special Offer</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/eb008a1787c04d7b19bdecdfbddbf8cf.avif?t=1682010912\" width=576 height=152 /></span><br><br>10% discount at launch!!<br><br>it's the big day of the game's release,<br>I hope you will enjoy it.<br>I have new ideas that I will soon share with you concerning the extension of the map...<br>thank you all</p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/8be5080b2f3a8dd6e28fd78cbf3e3243.avif?t=1682010912\" width=370 height=198 /></span><br><br>Basement of buildings<br><br>on March 3, with the faction of the soldiers, I introduce the basements of the buildings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/0b2e6bfad79ddfb1325b126ea3d0998a.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span><br>I'm thinking of making about ten different ones, some with zombies and others with enemy npc's.<br><br>I introduce a currency in the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/a50238a59db71a3285408e8f1a136f1c.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span><br>this will serve to develop trade between factions<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/48136f0c287efc70c866e35170ab764d.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span></p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/8742f4f8ae202c5d7000ebd1336a7543.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span><br><br>New content coming soon<br><br><br>this content is already ready, it has been tested. on the part reserved for the army, I implemented construction quests, quests to eliminate mini bosses and a quest to send resources.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/3fdeede7ed52d60e5a214155c4eb6a78.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span><br>all this allows you to obtain experience for the purchase of 2 vehicles already ready and a third in progress, which will have an integrated stock.<br><br>I modified the map to include the entrance to 3 bunkers, I tested the possibility of a basement, and it works well.<br><br>so I should set up an underground map in the roadmap.<br><br>I fixed small bugs, but nothing major.<br>everything I put in place I test it ..... I play my own game !!<br>and my goal is to enjoy it ... I am at your disposal if you have any mission ideas, I can't wait to read your suggestions<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/7bd4288e2efadd26fe664cef3e767611.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/87745f060a1e0c3a991bc9f834fd690e.avif?t=1682010912\" width=368 height=198 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/8d9271962af75e7b44ed07ec56aab7e3.avif?t=1682010912\" width=352 height=82 /></span><br>The survivors is a game in an open world populated by zombies and fanatical rebels but also survivors helped, craft and base bulding, missions are to be discovered<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > What Is the Survivors</h2></h2>Your transport plane has crashed you must survive the crash in a world populated by zombies and fanatics<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Features</h2></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover A World Rich In Original Places</li></ul></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/800bb66dfef6fd845b6296be23230838.avif?t=1682010912\" width=570 height=150 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><li> Fight Different Style Of Zombies<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2></li><li> Fight Armed Fanatics<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/2b090ef6629dcbb64b987ade40f1de98.avif?t=1682010912\" width=576 height=198 /></span><br></li><li> build its base, manage its electricity, its resources, recruit npc's which will produce building materials, ammunition, care<br></li><li> stop the proliferation of zombies by making traps<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Collect figurines from this world to decorate your base<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Meet other factions, complete helicopter rescue missions, reconstruction missions, delivery missions, deliver civilians, buy vehicles as rewards</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/3a88ff1aa99a7f31a7493e66bcd61953.avif?t=1682010912\" width=580 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Gameplay Style </strong></h2></h2></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >it's An Survival Game Style.</h2></h2>it's a deliberately arcade style, oriented on missions and action, and the discovery of the world, here you will only have few weapons in the often identical game play, no zombies to kill at 100m.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Developpement : Road Map </strong></h2></h2>we plan to to add new vehicles and their improvements, zombie bosses, new missions and a trade system between factions....<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/908adfcea82c3cb09194997622f86f6f.avif?t=1682010912\" width=580 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >what to Enjoy</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/fadc5d048c9a49d4166321795e2112eb.poster.avif?t=1682010912\" width=704 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/fadc5d048c9a49d4166321795e2112eb.webm?t=1682010912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/extras/fadc5d048c9a49d4166321795e2112eb.mp4?t=1682010912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul></li>","developers":["Guygames"],"dlc":[2388270],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264410/header.jpg?t=1682010912","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2264410/542596/a91d64489f5364901bb383bac98ccb23a02be9f3/1751096374/dash_av1.mpd?t=1677337021","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2264410/542596/a91d64489f5364901bb383bac98ccb23a02be9f3/1751096374/dash_h264.mpd?t=1677337021","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2264410/542596/a9